 "sentences": [
  "I can guide you toward resources that align with your interests and our company's needs.",
  "As you develop your skills, I expect you to contribute to these knowledge-sharing initiatives as well.",
  "I want you to stop using it altogether.",
  "I understand that it might be a comfortable habit, but in our fast-paced industry, efficiency and accessibility are key.",
  "I want you to start using a digital note-taking application instead.",
  "And with 'NoteBook', you can easily search your notes, which is far more efficient than flipping through a paper notebook.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or concerns about it, or any other matter.",
  "This helps us easily identify and distinguish our variables, especially when working with external libraries or collaborating on larger projects.",
  "Consistency in coding style makes the code more readable and maintainable, especially in a team environment.",
  "It's important to lay a solid foundation by taking the time to understand the requirements and plan your implementation.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if you encounter any challenges or need clarification on any aspect of the project.",
  "I'm here to support you and ensure your transition into the team is smooth and productive.",
  "Absolutely.",
  "Don't hesitate to utilize the tools and resources available, including Monday, to stay organized and efficient.",
  "I want you to start using it from now on.",
  "I'll ensure you get the necessary training and support to navigate the tool effectively."
 ],
